# S-24 — Beneficiary register (#100–#108). Result 30 Sep 2026 (local, Development): all as expected.
# #101 create teacher هيا العنزي 0551998218 → 201 B-000001 pending, nameMasked "ه••• ا•••", mobileMasked "05•••••218"
#   same mobile as +966… → 409 beneficiary.mobile_exists (mobile_hash) · bad kind/group/region/name/mobile → 400 with 5 fields
# #102 detail (masked, hasGuardian, units []) · #104 approved → verified_by/at; status "pending" → 400
# #105 reveal: admin → 403 auth.forbidden (RUL-62 SoD) · allocation_officer → 200 plaintext; no reason → 400;
#   audit_log beneficiary.reveal {code, reason} (never the values)
# #106 invite without an allocated seat → 409 beneficiary.no_live_seat (the SMS itself is sent from S-25)
# #100 list ?group&status → masked rows; ?status=nope → 400
# #108 template → text/csv; charset=utf-8, attachment, UTF-8 BOM + header row
# #107 import: dry run (default) of a bad file → 200 report rows 6, valid 2, errors [row 2 mobile_exists (register),
#   row 4 kind, row 7 mobile_exists (repeated in file), row 8 column count]; blank line skipped; quoted "خالد, الحربي" parsed
#   dryRun=false with errors → 422 beneficiary.import_invalid + report, nothing saved · good file dry run → valid 5, created 0 ·
#   real → created 5 (B-000002…006, pending) · same file again → 422 (all mobile_exists) · wrong header → 400
# PDPL: pg_dump of beneficiary + audit_log has no plaintext name or mobile; audit diffs write *** for every PII column;
#   api.log has no name or mobile
# roles: viewer 403 · no token 401 · allocation_officer 200 (list)
@base = http://localhost:5080/v1/admin/beneficiaries
@admin = <admin or allocation_officer access token>
@officer = <allocation_officer access token>

### #100 List
GET {{base}}?group=rural_private_school_teachers&status=approved&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### #101 Create
POST {{base}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"teacher","beneficiaryGroup":"rural_private_school_teachers","region":"القصيم","fullName":"هيا العنزي","mobile":"0551998218","organisationName":"مدرسة الهجرة الأهلية"}

### #102 Detail
GET {{base}}/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### #103 Update
PUT {{base}}/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"teacher","beneficiaryGroup":"rural_private_school_teachers","region":"القصيم","fullName":"هيا العنزي","mobile":"0551998218"}

### #104 Eligibility
POST {{base}}/{{id}}/eligibility
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"approved","zakatEligible":false,"notes":"تم التحقق"}

### #105 Reveal (allocation_officer only)
POST {{base}}/{{id}}/reveal
Authorization: Bearer {{officer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"verification call"}

### #106 Invite
POST {{base}}/{{id}}/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### #107 Import (multipart: file, dryRun=true|false)
POST {{base}}/import
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="b.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

kind,beneficiary_group,region,full_name,mobile,guardian_name,organisation_name,eligibility_notes
library,public_primary_libraries,الرياض,مكتبة الحي,,,مكتبة الحي العامة,
--b--

### #108 Template
GET {{base}}/import/template
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
